      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "hmmotion. One continuous locked-off cinematic Live2D-style wallpaper shot of the exact adult 3D anime game character from the first frame, rendered as a living high-end game character with refined MMD polish, not a plastic figurine.\n\nThe first and final frame must match in pose, expression, gaze, hair placement, costume placement, lighting and effects. Every motion follows a smooth low-amplitude periodic cycle and fully returns to its starting state before the end. Both eyes are fully open at the first and final frame. Perform one soft complete blink near the middle, never at either boundary.\n\nMany parts move simultaneously, but every movement remains small and elegant: one subtle breathing cycle; a barely perceptible balanced shoulder and upper-body sway; a tiny one-to-two-degree head inclination; a minute gaze adjustment and micro-expression; gentle independent secondary oscillations in front bangs, hair tips and long hair sections; restrained delayed follow-through in sleeves, ribbons, skirt hem and small costume ornaments; subtle cyclic environmental motion in nearby particles, plants, fabric, light sources and reflections. All parts return smoothly to their original state.\n\nPreserve the exact face, apparent adult age, eyes, hairstyle, costume coverage and patterns, body proportions, accessories, materials, full-body pose, subject placement, framing, background and color palette from the first frame. Keep the complete character visible from hair tips to both shoes. Hands, held props, hips, legs and feet remain spatially anchored; no step, body turn or large pose change.\n\nStatic camera and fixed focal length. Smooth coherent high-detail motion, stable facial features, stable costume patterns, stable anatomy, natural matte skin and controlled cinematic lighting. No camera movement, zoom, pan, tilt, roll, shake, cut, scene change, morphing, identity drift, face warping, costume change, exposure, large limb motion, bent props, extra fingers, extra limbs, duplicate objects, material crawling, lighting flicker, text, logo, watermark or subtitles."
      ],
      "title": "🟢 建议调 ②｜完整动作提示词",
      "color": "#1f5d3a",
      "bgcolor": "#163a29"
    },
